{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_title", "source_sha256": "e1a15a48dd0b262ab956744ea450b27132998b15795daa84894a3ca60770c26e", "ja": "永混", "zh": "永混", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1fd16fc84fa90e50f7db8204b6d8c75b9255229fcd2081840fd26d52bae42f32", "ja": "神降ろしの数日後、深淵海は凛音亞に次の\n村長になるべきは凛音亞だと唆す。混乱する\n凛音亞に逢路蘭は「夢なら夢でいいでしょ」\nと冷たく言い放つ。同じ結末を迎える中、\n永混は再び眠りから目を覚ますのだった。", "zh": "神降仪式数日后，深渊海怂恿凛音亚，说下一任村长应当由她来担任。面对困惑不已的凛音亚，逢路兰冷冷地说道：\"是梦的话，做梦也无妨。\"在迎来同样结局的过程中，永混再度从沉眠中醒来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1000_null", "source_sha256": "52a54d153a9ad85b17575567141b740c9a28a9adf411ac3f4dff571caa8589a8", "ja": "『神降ろし』　2日後……", "zh": "『请神』　2天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "deadbc9b0f2947fa1615e06c435de6138c59a4599132802f58201643662253c7", "ja": "やあ凛音亞、お邪魔しているよ。\nそうだ、君にお土産を持ってきたんだ。どうぞ！", "zh": "嗨，凛音亚，打扰了。\n对了，我给你带了伴手礼。请收下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "d6adecd01d85fcf0c4f09f7e429de96f8a47aeadbfb7729ab1e70f705f69ca08", "ja": "あら、深淵海先生。\nあ、ありがとうございます……。", "zh": "哎呀，深渊海老师。\n谢、谢谢您……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "7899d5638e664a62bb064250918bc7d1e89d6a206312cf8d3c663c6841d8d2d2", "ja": "皮を剥いて食べるといい。\nそうすれば、アレルギーは出ないはずだ。", "zh": "把皮剥掉再吃比较好。\n这样应该就不会引发过敏了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "138b091701a0f056d2b2e199f0b229a4aa701637d8ff0343f21b64ebad06038d", "ja": "亡くなったお父さんに聞いたよ、凛音亞。\n君の事を頼まれていてね。", "zh": "我听过你已故的父亲提起你，凛音亚。他拜托我照顾你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "cf7017bdfbba8a1909d15772c54ac4e29d776cd6b484d7d361c82fd3f7dd3838", "ja": "君は夜羽那お嬢さんの双子の姉……\nれっきとした、村長の娘だ。", "zh": "你是夜羽那小姐的双胞胎姐姐……\n是名正言顺的村长千金。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "7bfc29b4386348d05712b7216b8ad73c1648fcd57bff539bb2c05012e006c332", "ja": "！　ああ、やっぱり……。\nけど、どうして今さら……？", "zh": "！啊，果然……。\n可是，为什么偏偏是现在……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "8ddd9dc25dc2ec42d79e36fc19696873988f292500cccc53b74f2b6fb6827480", "ja": "彼も、私と同じ考えだったんじゃないかな？　やはり\n正当な後継者である君こそが、村長に相応しいと。", "zh": "他应该也和我想的一样吧？果然，只有作为名正言顺的继承人的你，才适合当村长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "d9c7a843f88f517f4a584e59c1f025d2b30d8c25b4fff734eb8925a9afcd09aa", "ja": "なに、簡単な事だよ。\nこうすればいいのさ……。", "zh": "没什么，很简单。\n这样做就行了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "aaa7667eb062dcd704136d128aacb6d8c38502fe606df007321c80441c743d04", "ja": "……！\n私が……夜羽那お嬢様を……？", "zh": "……！\n让我……去侍奉夜羽那小姐……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "4c0fd5289b7efd48667bda202e2923f3d91a8f62e1418124e8efeb93e8dec151", "ja": "大丈夫。私は、村の皆からの信頼も厚いんだ。\n君を推薦してあげるよ。だから、考えてくれたまえ。", "zh": "没事的。我在村里深得大家的信赖。\n我会推荐你的。所以，好好考虑一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "cfea6a470995e1c61440e292f137f0ccc4286c52be21d8c1d2e90009bc4e98d0", "ja": "あ、あら……逢路蘭。\nどうかしたの？", "zh": "啊、啊啦……逢路兰。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "0eebaf2df54193b5ecc3b2f26ebdb08f56671275c03ab2fb2000be656260ad4c", "ja": "何をどうするか、決めるのは神なんだ。\n……神に神を差し出すなんて、バカだよね。", "zh": "决定要做什么、该怎么做的，是神。……把神献给神，真是傻，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "85f196f7467f58bf688b077533a6d03548a621ab2a97a89bd9aef88a16c9d517", "ja": "あいつが余計な事をした、っていう話さ。\nお陰で、またやり直さなくちゃだよ。", "zh": "说的是那家伙多管闲事的事。\n多亏了他，我又得重新来过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "81c991a81b7069eb521047aa03f912cb19fd0802407e57554a6118773d0b5050", "ja": "逢路蘭……貴方、言葉が……？", "zh": "逢路兰……你、你的话……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "c2c4454c3eb402222f75bec28e6b9af105061409c6f5bdff1bfe94414eeaca3b", "ja": "さて。君と妹、どちらかを差し出さなくちゃ\nいけないとして……どっちにする？", "zh": "那么，要是非得把你和妹妹中的一个献出去……你选哪个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "69bf273807919ca2c62640185d25da947d87425df1a9164c44fa6defcfa5f3dd", "ja": "もちろん、どちらであっても失敗する可能性は\nあるけどね。決めるのは神様のご機嫌次第。", "zh": "当然，无论选哪一个，都有可能失败。不过，最终还是要看神明的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "b1e88f7386be2d526c1beec7e8a27d89eff72ad9ce1b2aadde64eed4ecc5397f", "ja": "それは……失敗したら、どうなるの。", "zh": "那要是……失败了，会怎么样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "4d1d01cbe1740759f7556ee89a6172416133efe51917f703af4157a3a72d4074", "ja": "みんな死ぬ。それだけだよ。", "zh": "大家都会死。仅此而已哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "32ae20752094b153cafcdf9664e3d25719d7591bc31d0030fce684b485dc49fe", "ja": "……ねえ。これって、夢なのかしら？　永混が\n私の身代わりになってくれたのも、みんな夢で……。", "zh": "……呐。这一切，难道是场梦吗？永混\n替我成了祭品什么的，全都是梦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "a1b46806a7d005102050dca2a74b78bf93efef5c0cb908a48b62a1c2794aff8e", "ja": "本物の私は、神降ろしに失敗して……\nもうとっくに、死んでいるんじゃないかしら……。", "zh": "真正的我，神降失败后……说不定早就已经死了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "9854bc673204a824977327c23e17c1c91e1d159034ab07d6862eae23824c625b", "ja": "そうかもしれない。\nけど、夢なら夢でいいでしょ。", "zh": "也许吧。\n不过，就算是梦，也没关系吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "c947ea332a90c915d248a7ed955d4cb2bfeb9585f6bf68d1a249c053c350ef91", "ja": "……。\nそう、ね……。", "zh": "……。\n是啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1026_null", "source_sha256": "acb68f87d8512be0322bb77578edc42527581ff17912a57ebfbd4d34f0094903", "ja": "そして……深淵海の言葉どおり、\n凛音亞は夜羽那を殺めた。", "zh": "然后……正如深渊海所说，凛音亞杀死了夜羽那。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "ab8858ba07f21516c25ba0c7d6720a52eb10cbdb4359ba766026f05626aa6f3e", "ja": "私のせいだ……。", "zh": "都是我的错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1028_037nao", "source_sha256": "95d58b49f2602e10a76b276e54bd6b410e4f0d90d36608e5cd72ccab4d403405", "ja": "全部、私のせいだったんだ……\n私が、原因だったんだ……。", "zh": "全都是我的错……\n原来是我造成的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "f0bdcf5c4d4f604519c4a137209ac95c15663a27917fcc0ed96d4f731831e024", "ja": "やれやれ。ほんと、懲りないよね。", "zh": "哎呀哎呀。你真是不知道吸取教训呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1030_037nao", "source_sha256": "39fced75edae436d36834a88e84880447f03c1cc74c1496834e71b84c349afd7", "ja": "逢路蘭……。", "zh": "逢路兰……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1031_040tam", "source_sha256": "d884e7e040b238a8654539e60a776928fbc6799b01af10a1cf92976666c60453", "ja": "本当に気の毒。どうして、人の心に値する\n理解なんて持ってしまったんだろうね。", "zh": "真是可怜。为什么偏偏拥有了理解人心的能力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "dff587c4247c662bdd9d4c19853af1d9bcd315d19f016cbbbb6a312f635423e0", "ja": "いつも同じ選択をして、いつも同じ間違いをして。\nそして、いつも傷付く。", "zh": "总是做出同样的选择，总是犯下同样的错误。\n然后，总是受到伤害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1033_040tam", "source_sha256": "018c1b2c07246341e036367d5bb3bbf5a4ea49bdc381a516ec1051ca9a49d1a6", "ja": "今回も、結末は変わらなかったけど……\nそれなりに、面白かったんじゃないかな？", "zh": "这次结局也没有改变，不过……\n还算挺有意思的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1035_040tam", "source_sha256": "961c91e2ed577b4b15759fb3da620e2fe49abe76229e06b5fae528423bfba746", "ja": "おやすみ。またね。", "zh": "晚安。下次见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1036_se", "source_sha256": "3895b8b8bc665bcc3dce99bd9673f051731bf6ff889fa2990853e52534b9c07a", "ja": "……パタン", "zh": "……啪嗒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1038_037nao", "source_sha256": "78f8e1faee249b3668da59014e3bdf16ef9c313943565c82d210fe8f5d1dd375", "ja": "……。\n……凛音亞！？", "zh": "……。\n……凛音亚！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1039_039kon", "source_sha256": "b6fc8a7042ec01ec4e8eed08656da7ad68093b2e95e56a45161ffea1be405ef8", "ja": "あら、起きたのね、永混。\n凛音亞？って誰？", "zh": "哎呀，你醒啦，永混。\n凛音亚？那是谁啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1040_037nao", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1041_039kon", "source_sha256": "9e0aa7e16b5dd2e212616ee2e64fdf8567f55712310496f0ef87ba37344e3066", "ja": "私は得瑠沙（エルサ）よ、永混。……長い事熱に\nうなされていたから、記憶が混乱しているのかしら。", "zh": "我是得瑠沙（艾尔莎），永混。……因为长时间被高烧折磨，记忆都混乱了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1042_040tam", "source_sha256": "f440e5956256f7a47af76c5cad8227367f2737aaf9df3cfac2e8c4226c2a0c9d", "ja": "得瑠沙！　永混、起きたの？", "zh": "得瑠沙！　永混，醒了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1043_039kon", "source_sha256": "bc65c20614b2194fd6ed4ff05a119756095540e68754a5e9a881e247a8b3f4a3", "ja": "ええ、逢路蘭。村長様と慧深璃亞（エミリア）\nお嬢様に知らせてくるから、永混の事見ていて頂戴。", "zh": "是的，逢路蘭。我去通知村长大人和慧深璃亞（艾米莉亚）大小姐，你帮我照看着永混。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_08_1044_040tam", "source_sha256": "bd528b9e6801733e1f3d5c456b71d7bca0ae9f2d678524097177d3c287cd06e7", "ja": "……おかえりなさい、永混（カミサマ）。", "zh": "……欢迎回来，永混（神明大人）。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
